n":"This Project Implements Javascript to create a safe password according to the user's choices","topics":[],"score":226886,"global_rank":160951},{"name":"dryland33/moviedex-api","owner":"dryland33","html_url":"https://github.com/dryland33/moviedex-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226886,"global_rank":160954},{"name":"dryland33/express-boilerplate","owner":"dryland33","html_url":"https://github.com/dryland33/express-boilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226886,"global_rank":160955},{"name":"binarybana/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","owner":"binarybana","html_url":"https://github.com/binarybana/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":2,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226883,"global_rank":160958},{"name":"karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","owner":"karmjeetnamol","html_url":"https://github.com/karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This project was bootstrapped with Create React App.  Acceptance Criteria GIVEN a single-page application portfolio for a web developer WHEN I load the portfolio THEN I am presented with a page containing a header, a section for content, and a footer WHEN I view the header THEN I am presented with the developer's name and navigation with titles corresponding to different sections of the portfolio WHEN I view the navigation titles THEN I am presented with the titles About Me, Portfolio, Contact, and Resume, and the title corresponding to the current section is highlighted WHEN I click on a navigation title THEN I am presented with the corresponding section below the navigation without the page reloading and that title is highlighted WHEN I load the portfolio the first time THEN the About Me title and section are selected by default WHEN I am presented with the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":226883,"global_rank":160959},{"name":"panchr/node-deployme","owner":"panchr","html_url":"https://github.com/panchr/node-deployme","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"NodeJS-driven deployment tool to push local changes to a remote server","topics":[],"score":226882,"global_rank":160960},{"name":"PeteLow-13/FunApp","owner":"PeteLow-13","html_url":"https://github.com/PeteLow-13/FunApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Full MERN stack app for parents to feel safe allowing kids to view and play preselected games and videos.","topics":[],"score":226881,"global_rank":160962},{"name":"petitepirate/jobly","owner":"petitepirate","html_url":"https://github.com/petitepirate/jobly","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226881,"global_rank":160974},{"name":"CanniJr/Redux-Counter","owner